status INFORMATION BOUND route and outcome evidence
status WARNING review or deferred route reverse evidence
status ERROR UNKNOWN or mismatched route reverse evidence

field code
field severity
field source_version
field contract_version
field route_status
field route_record_digest
field decision_digest
field expected_route_status
field observed_route_status
